            "created_at": "2025-07-11T16:04:21.795199+00:00",
            "notes": "I find Quick Scope to be an incredibly valuable item simply for the quick scoping alone, as it allows you to stay more mobile. It gets even more value when the enemy team has flying heroes or a Genji, as even a body shot will deal 98 damage with crits dealing 147 damage to airborne enemies at this point in the build. \n\nDash boots is incredibly valuable. If you're being dove it allows you to create some quick space. It allows you to quickly get behind cover, or even quickly reposition to get LOS.\n\nDepending on your funds, you might be able to afford Aftermarket Firing Pin. This is good for the attack speed, but mostly the move speed. If you can't afford it, I'll often get Heartbeat Sensor if you can at least afford that. I find the move speed from either of these items to be the best optional items, as it will give you 15% move speed total + your dash.",
