            "created_at": "2025-07-11T16:04:22.090464+00:00",
            "notes": "Sleep Regimen is a must this round, no matter your choice of power round 1. This is when you start to tank up, as every sleep hit will give you 10 permanent HP (up to the limit). I usually will have over 500 HP by round 5 with this power.\n\nIn my opinion, Tranquilizer is a must. This makes sleeps so easy to hit. Even if you're fairly decent at hitting sleeps, this item has so much carry potential, especially if the enemy team has Mercy, Juno, Genji, etc. You'll be sleeping that moth out of Valk consistently. If you're confident in your sleeps, aren't being dove, and don't feel this item provides benefit for the matchup, you can just buy the optional items, and keep prioritizing weapon power and attack speed. No matter what, you want to use sleep dart essentially off cooldown, as your goal is to start building your HP. However, If you're being dove a lot, save it for the dives.\n\nOptional items are same as last round, but I included Potent Projectiles too, as sometimes I farm enough for it + the other optional items. The projectile size makes hip fires (including headshots) very easy to hit. I still tend to prioritize Aftermarket Firing Pin for the move speed.",
