            "created_at": "2025-07-11T16:04:22.368355+00:00",
            "notes": "This round has a lot of optional items, as I find what I buy varies a lot depending on matchup, how much money I earned, etc.\n\nTo keep it simple:\n-If you find you're needing to heal a lot, or you prefer attack speed over weapon power, Wrist Wraps and Potent Projectiles are good choices thanks to the attack speed/bigger projectile. \n\n-If you're finding you have time to DPS/you're hitting headshots, and have the funds, go with the Closer (assuming you did pick Pinpoint Prescription).\n\n-If you're facing a Junker Queen, and no one on your team is doing Cyber Venom, El-Sa'Ka Suppressor can be a good choice.\n\n-If you find you need even more suvivability, Phantasmic Flux is a great choice.\n\nTLDR - For the optional items, prioritize weapon power/attack speed, whichever suits your playstyle/the matchup better. Personally, both are valuable, but I like to keep enough weapon power to 2-shot enemy squishies with headshots. If you need more survivability still, Phatasmic Flux can be good.",
