            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-11T16:04:22.634582+00:00",
            "notes": "This is a very flexible round, both for power and items. These later rounds are where I find you adapt based on how the match is going.\n\nPowers:\n-Since the recent buff, I've found Our Turn provides an insane amount of value, especially if you can communicate and plan the group nano. Lately, this is most often my round 5 pick.\n-If you're playing into Ashe burn build, or still being dove and need more self sustain, Home Remedy is a great choice for the overhealth.\n-If the rest of your team is bad, and you've somehow DPS'ed well enough to make it to this round, get My Turn. As well, if you're being focused, you can use nano simply to save your life. If you're using self nano offensively, try to ensure you have your cooldowns, especially nade, when you pop it.\n-Venom nade is just plain satisfying, so sometimes I'll pick that, especially if it's a match where I'm hitting fat nades.\n\nItems:\n-If you did pick Home Remedy or Venomous,  [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb) might be a good choice if you feel the value outweighs more weapon power/attack speed.\n\n-If you want more attack speed and can afford it, get  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) and sell  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).\n\n-If you want more damage, get  [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce).\n\n-If you're a bit strapped for cash, maybe some Rares will be better for your overall stats. Hence the inclusion of them as optional still. Prioritize weapon power or attack speed to suit your needs.\n\n-If survival is still an issue, [ [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is still a good choice.",
